menu "Medusa Wi-Fi internals lab"

config MEDUSA_LAB_CHANNEL
    int "Initial 2.4 GHz channel"
    range 1 13
    default 1
    help
        Initial fixed channel for passive management-frame counting and the
        single-frame, operator-triggered transmit experiments.

config MEDUSA_LAB_COUNTRY_CODE
    string "ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 Wi-Fi country code"
    default "PT"
    help
        Passed to esp_wifi_set_country_code(). This lab does not bypass the
        Wi-Fi driver's regulatory or channel controls.

endmenu
